entries[168368] = { ["name"] = "Recipe: Famine Evaluator And Snack Table", ["text"] = "Rank 3\nBinds when picked up\nUnique\nUse: Teaches you how to craft F.E.A.S.T. more effectively.\nPrepare F.E.A.S.T.s more efficiently, using significantly fewer materials.\nRequires Kul Tiran Cooking (175)\nRequires Rustbolt Resistance\n- Exalted\nSell Price:\nFamine Evaluator And Snack Table\nUse: Set out a F.E.A.S.T. to feed up to 35 people in your raid or party!\n\nRestores 50769 health and 30769 mana over 20 sec. Must remain seated while eating. If you spend at least 10 seconds eating you will become well fed and gain 50 in a stat for 1 hour.\nSell Price:\nRequires Viper Fish (15), Ionized Minnow (15), Stringy Loins (15), Meaty Haunch (15), Fresh Potato (20), S.P.A.R.E. Crate" }
