entries[168625] = { ["name"] = "Vantus Rune Technique: The Eternal Palace", ["text"] = "Rank 1\nBinds when picked up\nUse: Teaches you how to craft a Vantus Rune: The Eternal Palace.\nCraft a Vantus Rune: The Eternal Palace.\nRequires Kul Tiran Inscription (155)\nSell Price:\nVantus Rune: The Eternal Palace\nUse: Attune yourself to the energies of the targeted The Eternal Palace raid boss, increasing your Versatility by 2078 when fighting that boss. This effect lasts for an entire week.\n\nYou can only use one Vantus Rune per week.\nSell Price:\nRequires Light Parchment , Maroon Ink (20), Ultramarine Ink (10)" }
