entries[168674] = { ["name"] = "Abyssal Alchemist Stone", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nUnique-Equipped\nTrinket\n+ 10 Versatility\n\nPrismatic Socket\nEquip: When you heal or deal damage you have a chance to increase your Strength, Agility, or Intellect by 27 for 15 sec. Your highest stat is always chosen.\nEquip: Increases the effect that healing and mana potions have on the wearer by 40%. This effect does not stack.\nRequires Kul Tiran Alchemy (165)\n\"Can be used for transmutations in place of a Philosopher's Stone.\"\nSell Price:" }
